T1440	Entity 270167 270181	the councillor
T1441	Quotation 270183 270432	"You, farmers, agricultural labourers! you pacific pioneers of a work that belongs wholly to civilization! you, men of progress and morality, you have understood, I say, that political storms are even more redoubtable than atmospheric disturbances!"
T1442	Quotation 270433 270452	"It comes one day,"
