T2684	Quotation 421933 421943	"But why,"
T2685	Cue 421944 421949	asked
T2686	Entity 421950 421956	Bovary
T2687	Quotation 421958 421994	"does that gentleman persecute her?"
T2688	Quotation 421995 422004	"No, no!"
T2689	Entity 422005 422008	she
T2690	Cue 422009 422017	answered
T2691	Quotation 422019 422037	"he is her lover!"
T2692	Quotation 422038 422300	"Yet he vows vengeance on her family, while the other one who came on before said, 'I love Lucie and she loves me!' Besides, he went off with her father arm in arm. For he certainly is her father, isn't he-- the ugly little man with a cock's feather in his hat?"
T2693	Entity 422082 422114	the other one who came on before
T2694	Cue 422115 422119	said
T2695	Quotation 422121 422153	'I love Lucie and she loves me!'
T2697	Entity 422549 422551	He
T2698	Cue 422552 422561	confessed
T2699	Quotation 422573 422673	that he did not understand the story because of the music, which interfered very much with the words
T2700	Quotation 422675 422697	"What does it matter?"
T2701	Cue 422698 422702	said
T2702	Entity 422703 422707	Emma
T2703	Quotation 422709 422723	"Do be quiet!"
T2704	Quotation 422724 422744	"Yes, but you know,"
T2705	Entity 422745 422747	he
T2706	Cue 422748 422755	went on
T2707	Entity 422773 422776	her
T2708	Quotation 422787 422817	"I like to understand things."
T2709	Quotation 422818 422839	"Be quiet! be quiet!"
T2710	Entity 422840 422843	she
T2711	Cue 422844 422849	cried
T2712	Entity 425848 425851	She
T2713	Entity 425963 425966	him
T2714	Cue 425971 425978	cry out
T2715	Quotation 425980 426072	"Take me away! carry me with you! let us go! Thine, thine! all my ardour and all my dreams!"
T2716	Entity 427004 427011	Charles
T2717	Entity 427020 427028	his wife
T2718	Cue 427030 427036	saying
T2719	Quotation 427067 427157	"Ma foi! I thought I should have had to stay there. There is such a crowd-- SUCH a crowd!"
T2720	Entity 427158 427160	HE
T2721	Cue 427161 427166	ADDED
T2722	Quotation 427169 427217	"Just guess whom I met up there! Monsieur Leon!"
T2723	Quotation 427218 427225	"Leon?"
T2724	Quotation 427226 427275	"Himself! He's coming along to pay his respects."
T2726	Entity 427349 427351	He
T2727	Entity 427708 427711	she
T2728	Cue 427760 427770	stammering
T2729	Quotation 427792 427823	"Ah, good-day! What! you here?"
T2730	Quotation 427824 427834	"Silence!"
T2731	Cue 427835 427840	cried
T2732	Entity 427841 427861	a voice from the pit
T2733	Quotation 427896 427918	"So you are at Rouen?"
T2734	Quotation 427919 427925	"Yes."
T2735	Quotation 427926 427943	"And since when?"
T2736	Quotation 427944 427975	"Turn them out! turn them out!"
T2737	Entity 427999 428003	them
T2738	Quotation 428811 428833	"Does this amuse you?"
T2739	Cue 428834 428838	said
T2740	Entity 428839 428841	he
T2741	Entity 428856 428859	her
T2743	Entity 428920 428923	She
T2744	Cue 428924 428931	replied
T2745	Quotation 428945 428973	"Oh, dear me, no, not much."
T2746	Entity 428979 428981	he
T2747	Cue 428982 428990	proposed
T2748	Quotation 428991 429058	that they should leave the theatre and go and take an ice somewhere
T2749	Quotation 429060 429087	"Oh, not yet; let us stay,"
T2750	Cue 429088 429092	said
T2751	Entity 429093 429099	Bovary
T2752	Quotation 429101 429149	"Her hair's undone; this is going to be tragic."
T2753	Quotation 429254 429277	"She screams too loud,"
T2754	Cue 429278 429282	said
T2755	Entity 429283 429286	she
T2756	Entity 429299 429306	Charles
T2757	Quotation 429327 429345	"Yes -- a little,"
T2758	Entity 429346 429348	he
T2759	Cue 429349 429356	replied
T2760	Entity 429426 429434	his wife
T2761	Entity 429463 429467	LEON
T2762	Cue 429468 429472	SAID
T2763	Quotation 429475 429492	"The heat is -- "
T2764	Quotation 429493 429511	"Unbearable! Yes!"
T2765	Quotation 429512 429533	"Do you feel unwell?"
T2766	Cue 429534 429539	asked
T2767	Entity 429540 429546	Bovary
T2768	Quotation 429548 429580	"Yes, I am stifling; let us go."
T2769	Entity 429755 429759	they
T2770	Cue 429760 429765	spoke
T2771	Quotation 429766 429780	of her illness
T2772	Entity 430234 430266	People coming out of the theatre
T2773	Cue 430294 430313	humming or shouting
T2774	Quotation 430342 430365	"O bel ange, ma Lucie!"
T2775	Entity 430371 430375	Leon
T2776	Cue 430410 430414	talk
T2777	Quotation 430415 430420	music
T2778	Quotation 430577 430583	"Yet,"
T2779	Cue 430584 430595	interrupted
T2780	Entity 430596 430603	Charles
T2781	Quotation 430645 430770	"they say that he is quite admirable in the last act. I regret leaving before the end, because it was beginning to amuse me."
T2782	Quotation 430771 430777	"Why,"
T2783	Cue 430778 430782	said
T2784	Entity 430783 430792	the clerk
T2785	Quotation 430794 430834	"he will soon give another performance."
T2786	Entity 430839 430846	Charles
T2787	Cue 430847 430854	replied
T2788	Quotation 430855 430889	that they were going back next day
T2789	Quotation 430891 430900	"Unless,"
T2790	Entity 430901 430903	he
T2791	Cue 430904 430909	added
T2792	Entity 430922 430930	his wife
T2793	Quotation 430932 430971	"you would like to stay alone, kitten?"
T2794	Entity 431162 431169	Charles
T2795	Cue 431170 431178	insisted
T2796	Quotation 431181 431302	"You would get back on Sunday. Come, make up your mind. You are wrong if you feel that this is doing you the least good."
T2797	Quotation 431558 431578	"I am really sorry,"
T2798	Cue 431579 431583	said
T2799	Entity 431584 431590	Bovary
T2800	Quotation 431592 431627	"about the money which you are -- "
T2801	Entity 431628 431637	The other
T2802	Cue 431701 431705	said
